// ============================================================================
// EMPLOYEE QUERY HELPERS: what Shift Start's saved assignments say about one person
// ============================================================================
// Shift Start saves one craa5_taskassignment row per person: craa5_id = their name, craa5__aaemp_guid = their employee id,
// craa5_area = the room (or PTO / Sick / Late / Left Early / NCNS when they are out), craa5_lead = their lead (blank or the
// supervisor's own name for a room the supervisor holds), craa5_team = the supervisor, craa5_starttime / craa5_endtime =
// when the row began and was closed. Moving someone saves a new row. The employee hubs write equipment progress rows with
